      "contract": "Owns strict import gates, bulk local CVE vetting, versioned Quality/Urgency/temperature snapshots and persistent usable-observation dispositions. Preserves original files, policy history, attribution jobs and explicit notification workflow. Durable analyst identity approvals remain separate from each endpoint's immutable evidence.",
